::PC_U06_L05_Q_Q01::
Question ID: PC_U06_L05_Q_Q01
MLA Standard: MLA.PC.SEQ.4
Question:
A geometric sequence has first term 3 and common ratio 3. Which expression gives a_n? Use item context 1 to select the best answer.
{
~A. 3+3(n-1) #This choice uses a related idea but does not complete the required reasoning for the stated standard.
~B. 3(3)^(n-1) #This choice reflects a common misconception or an incomplete step.
~C. 3(3)n #This choice does not match the conditions in the question.
=D. 3(3)^(n-1) #Correct. This answer follows the lesson concept and connects the result to the stated standard.
}

